# Deeper rings.  At 30 GB/s a ring of 256 is 150 microseconds of frames; the
# loan cells drop tens to hundreds of thousands a cell and the client's
# congestion window sits near 60 segments.  The plain wire carries 49 GB/s to
# sixteen streams held at 1 MiB with 24 drops (wirebuf.sh).  As deep as a
# 6144-page region allows with each load.
512 1048576 0 prp step-copy-n16
1024 1048576 0 prp step-copy-n16
1024 524288 0 prp step-copy-n16
512 786432 16 prp step-on-n16
512 1048576 14 prp step-on-n16
256 1048576 16 prp step-on-n16
